* Procedure : InterpXS.c2m
* Purpose : Interpolate cross-sections on axially varying properties
* Author : R. Guasch
* Date : 09/06/2025
* Input data :
*   - Fmap : fuel map with local parameters
*   - Cpo : MULTICOMPO hosting XS data to be interpolated
*   - MicroF : MULTICOMPO to store interpolated XS data
*   - Nz : number of axial nodes (NZ)
*--------------
* INPUT - OUTPUT LCM data / parameters definition/recovery
*--------------
PARAMETER MicroF Fmap Cpo ::
::: LINKED_LIST MicroF Fmap Cpo ; ;
INTEGER Nz ;
:: >>Nz<< ;
*--------------
* MODULES definition
*--------------
MODULE NCR: END: ;
*--------------
* Variable declaration
*--------------
ECHO 'Interpolate cross-sections on axially varying properties' ;
ECHO 'Interpolation on Nz nodes' Nz ;
*--------------
* Interpolation of cross-sections on axially varying properties
*--------------
MicroF := NCR: Cpo Fmap ::
EDIT 0
NMIX <<Nz>>
MICRO LINEAR
TABLE Cpo EDIPARAM
MIX 1 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 2 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 3 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 4 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 5 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 6 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 7 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 8 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 9 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 10 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 11 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 12 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 13 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 14 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 15 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 16 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 17 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 18 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 19 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
MIX 20 INST-BURN SET 'TFuel' MAP SET 'TCool' MAP SET 'DCool' MAP ENDMIX
;
END: ;
QUIT .
